  "summary": "This C40 case study describes “Reducing GHG Emissions through Community-Driven City Clean-Ups,” an urban initiative documented for Nairobi. It is included because it addresses air pollution pm25 hazards, and it has evidence relevant to children's livelihoods, and it is located in the Global South. C40 describes the action this way: Nairobi City County Government has been engaging local communities in monthly clean-ups as a way of eliminating illegal dumpsites and sensitizing residents…",
